<title>NEW ZEALAND: Colonial sets NZ$0.20 special dividend.</title>
<headline>Colonial sets NZ$0.20 special dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colonial Motors said on Thursday it would pay a fully imputed NZ$0.20 per share special dividend, payable on January 27, 1997.</p>
<p>Books close January 17.  </p>
<p>Colonial, 33.9 percent owned by Guinness Peat Group, recently announced a plan to cancel four out of five shares next April, pending High Court approval.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
